Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Register BGZ09, Sho04, Gen09 and Vad12 in sources.json

Four rows added with scripts/reference_coverage.py --register, titles
filled in afterwards in the existing {title, documents} schema; the
registry now holds 26 tags. The schema carries no hash field, so, as in
DW-7, each upload's SHA-256 is recorded in its own .raw.md and .md
header, and the four hashes are tabulated in the ingest report.

All eight files parse with proofmatch's validated-Markdown reader, and
every anchor matches proofmatch.document.stable_block_id for its
fingerprint, page and sequence.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PqpVTiHmukksJvfBE1Db8V
